      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9311/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix 1 cup sugar, butter, and egg together in a medium bowl until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fkPA5lmlQg0bwECNPb_Rw524dtQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-9311-Molasses-Cookies-DDMFS-Step-01-b-e799f22b172c4118b5953cb468dbd637.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9311/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in molasses.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/h8wPfEvPPST58jIQOYKH2NYeFbU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-9311-Molasses-Cookies-DDMFS-Step-02-3c7313b5ce10487aacc1bfe7cac9116a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9311/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine flour, baking soda, cinnamon, salt, cloves, and ginger in a separate medium bowl; add to the molasses mixture and stir until well combined. Cover and chill dough for 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XIYhbPNSD_4HjTYmpfrKzo0R8CY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-9311-Molasses-Cookies-DDMFS-Step-03-a235817655bc48bca411393eb8d09607.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9311/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). While the oven is preheating, roll dough into 1-inch diameter balls; roll each ball in remaining 1/2 cup white sugar before placing 2 inches apart on ungreased cookie sheets.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lSQbImei1lg7X2THzfV4SEqkFVI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-9311-Molasses-Cookies-DDMFS-Step-04-b-2a7bd1edf19e466286041d0c42b40fa2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9311/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in batches in the preheated oven until tops are cracked, about 8 to 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mjPUjpO3SpzdrPXpi3CiQgUiZcg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-9311-Molasses-Cookies-DDMFS-Step-05-4ecd6d2cb5fb4dffa6687b5f68923b6b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9311/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
